        <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium mb-2">
          Associate Scientific Director | Chemical Synthesis
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base opacity-70 mb-6">
          Biocon Bristol Myers Squibb R&amp;D Center (BBRC),
          Syngene International Ltd.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-8">
          Synthetic organic chemist with multidisciplinary academic and 
          industrial research experience spanning synthetic methodology, small-ring heterocycle chemistry,
          photoredox catalysis, pharmaceutical drug discovery, and advanced antibody–drug conjugate 
          (ADC) research. My work connects fundamental reaction development
          with the practical synthesis of complex molecules for pharmaceutical research.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">

          <a href="/research" class="btn btn-outline">
            Research
          </a>

          <a href="/papers" class="btn btn-outline">
            Publications
          </a>

          <a href="/cv" class="btn btn-outline">
            Curriculum Vitae
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>


      <!-- Hero Photo -->
